<!--
  SYNTHETIC SAMPLE — NO REAL TAXPAYER DATA.

  BRANCH PROVED: THE NEGATIVE GATE of the HKS charge block — a document-level
  cac:AllowanceCharge with ChargeIndicator=TRUE on an ORDINARY invoice
  (TEMELFATURA / SATIS). Here cbc:ChargeTotalAmount means what the guide says it
  means (UBL-TR Ortak Elemanlar §2.2.37: "toplam fiyat artırımı") and it is
  ADDED, not subtracted:
      LineExtension 3.000,00 + ChargeTotal 300,00 = TaxExclusive 3.300,00
      TaxInclusive 3.900,00 = PayableAmount 3.900,00
  The template must keep calling this row "Toplam Artırım" and must draw NO
  charge block here. Without this sample the HKS rename could quietly spread to
  every profile and nothing would catch it.
-->
